Ahhh, this is very exciting! All of the ponlojbo should join the primary 
list and talk to us in Lojban!

Also, is the Japanese translation community aware of the fact that we're 
rewriting and reformatting the CLL (twice)? I don't want them to go through 
a bunch of effort just to have it negated. I think it would be good if they 
worked closely with Lojban central to make sure everything is correct (I 
believe Twey and lorx speak Japanese, so it shouldn't be too hard).

I'm very excited to have a new national group as part of Lojbanistan!

